	"metadata": {
		"boundary": "SelectionCandidate wire record -> selectCapabilityImplementation",
		"why": "The decomposition moved SelectionCandidate into @hobo/manifest-request while the gates that read it stayed in @hobo/capability-profiles. This pact is verified by REPLAY, not by being read: each interaction's candidate records are decoded with fromSelectionCandidateRecord and run through selectCapabilityImplementation, and the verdict must equal the response. A codec that widened a vocabulary, dropped an optional, or normalised an absent field would change a verdict here rather than passing a structural comparison."
